ex:Del4_CriticalPoints a backlog:ScopeDeliverable ;
    rdfs:label "The critical points of chapters 1 to 8, revived from the course and listed with their sources, and the points not found listed plainly for the owner"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage4 ;
    backlog:derivesFromMissionClause "The SEN0401 midterm exam covers chapters 1 to 8 of Mastering Bitcoin's third edition as the course teaches them"^^xsd:string ;
    backlog:hasDeliverableText "A list, as a new file, of the critical points of chapters 1 to 8, each with its source (a slide and its speaker note, a corpus passage, a page or a story, with chapter and number), and a separate plain list of the points the owner explained that no source carries, to be put to him. No point is invented: a point without a source is on the second list." ;
    backlog:deliverableForArea ex:Area4_Sources ; backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Work ; backlog:hasProductScopeKind backlog:Kind_Functional .
ex:Del4_Engine a backlog:ScopeDeliverable ;
    rdfs:label "One general exam engine that builds an exam across chapters and refuses a build that breaks a convention"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage4 ;
    backlog:derivesFromMissionClause "The SEN0401 midterm exam covers chapters 1 to 8 of Mastering Bitcoin's third edition as the course teaches them"^^xsd:string ;
    backlog:hasDeliverableText "A general exam engine, as new tool files, that builds an exam from items of any chapters 1 to 8, including cross-chapter, synthesis and indirect items, and checks its constraints (answer letters even, Bloom majority higher-order, chapter weights, items of the two exams disjoint or marked shared, version incremented) and refuses a build that breaks one; its checks are shown on fixtures whose answer is known." ;
    backlog:deliverableForArea ex:Area4_Exams ; backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Work ; backlog:hasProductScopeKind backlog:Kind_Functional .
ex:Del4_Items a backlog:ScopeDeliverable ;
    rdfs:label "The items of the two exams, each grounded in a source, in the question types that suit paper"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage4 ;
    backlog:derivesFromMissionClause "The SEN0401 midterm exam covers chapters 1 to 8 of Mastering Bitcoin's third edition as the course teaches them"^^xsd:string ;
    backlog:hasDeliverableText "The items of two exams as new files: each item names its source (and its critical point), its chapters, its Bloom level and its type; every term is in the course corpus; items need course knowledge; the existing banks are used and extended, never edited." ;
    backlog:deliverableForArea ex:Area4_Exams ; backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Work ; backlog:hasProductScopeKind backlog:Kind_Functional .
