    backlog:derivesFromMissionClause "The SEN0401 midterm exam covers chapters 1 to 8 of Mastering Bitcoin's third edition as the course teaches them"^^xsd:string ;
    backlog:hasDeliverableText "The question types and styles allowed on a printed paper, and the methods that reduce the printed pages (named, with the page count each saves, measured), written as SHACL shapes in a new file and enforced by the engine; ruling in SHACL, not markdown." ;
    backlog:deliverableForArea ex:Area4_Paper ; backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Work ; backlog:hasProductScopeKind backlog:Kind_Functional .
