ex:Gap4_AnswerSheet_SuspensionException a backlog:BlueprintGap ; rdfs:label "No coverage yet for the Answer sheet at the suspension or exception stage"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage4 ; backlog:gapForEntity ex:DE4_AnswerSheet ; backlog:gapForStage backlog:Stage_SuspensionException ; backlog:hasGapReason "No suspension or exception work is planned for this entity in this lineage; it is matured in a later box if the owner needs it." .
