ex:Gap4_StudentPaper_Termination a backlog:BlueprintGap ; rdfs:label "No coverage yet for the Student paper at the termination stage"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage4 ; backlog:gapForEntity ex:DE4_StudentPaper ; backlog:gapForStage backlog:Stage_Termination ; backlog:hasGapReason "No termination work is planned: the exams are made once for this midterm and nothing is retired by this lineage." .
