    backlog:dissolutionRationale "The owner's rule of 2026-11-18: work left in a closed lineage is moved to a live lineage or closed. The fourth lineage was abandoned on 2026-10-29 and this planned sprint never ran; every member is cancelled (Closure_5) because the same work is carried by the third lineage's exam stories and onward by the sixth lineage." .
