to block becomes case 1 (order of a spending chain back to the coinbase transaction, same ordering answer block). The other items stay unless the topic list shows a gap, which the executor reports and fills only by replacing, never by adding (the structure stays 25/25/25/25 + 10, one unit per sub-question). Done exam stories and tasks are not edited (G125)." .
