ex:CR3_Ch03PageRepair a backlog:ChangeRequest ;
    rdfs:label "The chapter 3 page v9_74_0 is repaired as a new page"@en ;
    backlog:requestsChangeTo ex:Scope3 ; backlog:hasChangeDirection backlog:Direction_Grow ; backlog:hasDisposition backlog:Disp_Accepted ; rdfs:seeAlso ex:CR3_MidtermSimplify ;
    backlog:hasChangeRequestRationale "DEFECT (measured by the lineage agent, 2026-11-01, quiet window, back to back under one lock hold of /tmp/page_test.lock, load average 0.5 to 1.2): the chapter 3 page v9_74_0 (commits 255cd45, a2a7f50, 08bb147, 10c1013; built from the 61-slide Teach deck v3_2_0) fails the main-thread budget feature that the shipped v9_73_0 passes. Test 9.38.0: v9_74_0 396 passed 2 failed, longest main-thread task 762 ms, after load 762 ms over 23 long tasks; v9_73_0 398 passed 0 failed, longest 113 ms, after load 67 ms over 2 long tasks. Test 9.34.3: v9_74_0 372 passed 2 failed, longest 580 ms; v9_73_0 374 passed 0 failed, longest 145 ms. The load-task medians are normal (129 against 142 ms), so the extra work comes after load. By contrast the chapter 5 diagnostic showed load only (9.38.0 passed on both v9.91.0 and v9.84.0). " .
