ex:CR3_CombinedRunProof a backlog:ChangeRequest ;
    rdfs:label "The combined page-test run is proven by a source-diff tool"@en ;
    backlog:requestsChangeTo ex:Scope3 ; backlog:hasChangeDirection backlog:Direction_Grow ; backlog:hasDisposition backlog:Disp_Accepted ; rdfs:seeAlso ex:CR3_MidtermSimplify ;
    backlog:hasChangeRequestRationale "FINDING (lineage agent, 2026-11-02): the page-test stage costs about 13 minutes of the shared browser lock per run, and every page is run with several test versions (9.38.0, 9.34.3 and the older ones). By feature NAME, 9.38.0 contains every feature of 9.34.3 and 9.35.3 on chapter 2 (187, 187 and 199 names, 0 outside); 9.38.0 differs from 9.34.3 in 13 source lines and from 9.35.3 in 7 (diff counts of the committed files). A name match is NOT a proof that the check is the same, so no combined run may be relied on yet. The aim is one combined 9.38.0 run per page instead of two, saving about 13 minutes of lock time per page, WITHOUT weakening any gate. " .
