    rdfs:label "What the exam move to CME costs and touches"@en ;
    backlog:analyzesRequest ex:CR3_ExamMoveCME ; backlog:identifiesAffectedLineage ex:Lineage3 ;
    backlog:hasImpactStatement "OWNER DECISION (2026-11-02, 10:27 Istanbul, relayed by the coordinator): move the exams to the CME repository, which is private. Background measured by the lineage agent: the SEN0401 repository is PUBLIC and its history already holds exam papers, keys and items with answers (papers_midterm_v1, v2 and v3, items v1.1.0 to v1.3.0). A copy executor started at 2026-11-02T07:28:00Z and copies the exam material (08-tooling/exam including private/, the papers, the items, and the backup folder) to the CME repository; it deletes nothing. THE ORDER, in the owner's words 'move': after the copy is verified by hash, the answer-bearing tracked exam files are removed from the working tree of the public SEN0401 repository by a new commit. Committed history stays: a history rewrite is NOT decided and NOT ordered. From now on every NEW exam artefact (the items merge, the papers, keys, sheets) is written to the CME location that the copy executor reports and not to the SEN0401 repository; private/ stays only as scratch until then. The guard in .gitignore stays.  AFFECTED: one new story with two tasks (about 4 agent-hours); no existing task depends on it, but every later exam artefact is written to the CME location; the open items are re-ranked (G147)." .
