ex:CR3_ExamMoveFollow a backlog:ChangeRequest ;
    rdfs:label "The exam move to CME is completed and the scripts are repointed"@en ;
    backlog:requestsChangeTo ex:Scope3 ; backlog:hasChangeDirection backlog:Direction_Grow ; backlog:hasDisposition backlog:Disp_Accepted ; rdfs:seeAlso ex:CR3_MidtermSimplify ;
    backlog:hasChangeRequestRationale "FINDING (lineage agent, 2026-11-02, control of the removal commit cd9706c, which passed my own check: 41 files deleted, each with an equal-hash copy in CME): the owner's order is 'move the exams to the private CME repository' (10:27). Answer-bearing files still tracked in the PUBLIC SEN0401 tree: the rebuilt first-form papers in 08-tooling/verify/iter54/ctl/papers_rebuilt/ (chapter and type papers, their keys as json and pdf, paper.ttl, measure and layout files; CME has no copy at that path), and possibly bridge and check logs under 08-tooling/verify/ and 08-tooling/exam/ that print answer values (not yet inspected; the generic words answer or expected in 61 candidate logs are not proof). Also tracked control scripts of the lineage read paths that were removed (for example papers_midterm_v1/..., items_midterm v1_0_0 to v1_3_0, the rebuilt papers): they fail until they read the copies in CME (the private CME clone at /home/claude/CME/exams/SEN0401/). Committed history stays; a history rewrite is not decided and not ordered. " .
