ex:CR3_ExamV6 a backlog:ChangeRequest ;
    rdfs:label "The midterm exam is corrected as v6 (six owner points)"@en ;
    backlog:requestsChangeTo ex:Scope3 ; backlog:hasChangeDirection backlog:Direction_Grow ; backlog:hasDisposition backlog:Disp_Accepted ; rdfs:seeAlso ex:CR3_MidtermSimplify ;
    backlog:hasChangeRequestRationale "OWNER CORRECTIONS (2026-11-02, 12:09 Istanbul, relayed by the coordinator) to the delivered SEN0401 midterm v5 (one form, paper 6 pages, key 3, sheet 1; CME commit 50228be): six points, each carried by the story that owns it: (1) answer space on the sheet for every part that has none; (2) the answers written on the question pages are the legal answers and the sheet is an option for fast reading; (3) the vanity-address item is out of scope; (4) plain directions; (5) short stems, tips out of the stems onto a tips page, the second page of the answer sheet; (6) no free 25 percent gain for blind answers on four options. The owner's priority: this exam first. Writes go to the private CME clone (exams/SEN0401/...); nothing with a question or an answer goes into the public repository; engine, builders and sheet module are new versioned copies; no gate is weakened. A repair change re-ranks the open items. " .
