ex:CR3_ExamV6FloorMove a backlog:ChangeRequest ;
    rdfs:label "The SEN0401 tools are moved to the floored scoring module"@en ;
    backlog:requestsChangeTo ex:Scope3 ; backlog:hasChangeDirection backlog:Direction_Grow ; backlog:hasDisposition backlog:Disp_Accepted ; rdfs:seeAlso ex:CR3_MidtermSimplify ;
    backlog:hasChangeRequestRationale "FOLLOW-UP of the floor correction (owner ruling 2026-11-02 16:52 Istanbul: the paper total is floored at 0). The executor of the correction found that other SEN0401 tools still import the scoring module v1_0_0 and report an unfloored total: the sheet modules, the sheet checks and some lineage scripts. They are moved to the scoring module v1_1_0 as new versioned copies, after the exams are delivered; not urgent. Committed files are never edited. The SEN0414 sheet module is outside this item (its own lineage)." .
