swers by the sheet or the question pages, numbers and traces hand-written on the question page compared with the key value (the exact value gives full points, else 0, no partial credit), the question pages are the legal copy, no arithmetic beyond adding points; (7) cover and directions: every penalty sentence and the two-answers deduction wording removed; the legal-copy sentence and the rule 'two answers in one place count as no answer' stay. The deliverable set carries ONE version: sen0401_exam_midterm_v7_0_0_paper.docx and .pdf, _key.docx and .pdf, _sheet.pdf, and SHA256.txt." .
