, in one clause each, why each other option is wrong; the key renders them (the key is not counted in the 6 pages); (e) a new clarity check (new files) refuses undefined references, a missing intention sentence and a key entry without steps, proven on fixtures of known answer; no existing gate is weakened (R1 stem at most 60 words, R4 format line at most 25 words, tips at most 12 words and R6 abbreviations stay); (f) paper plus sheet at most 6 pages, the sheet one page with the Question 2 boxes; (g) the SegWit tip is spelled out (Segregated witness). The topics, the critical points, the positions, the types and the whole points of the items stay (no critical point loses its holder); the correct answer of an item may change only if the rewrite needs it, and every key value is recomputed by RUNNING code. The student sheet stays results-only by the earlier rulings (exact value, no partial credit); the intermediate steps are in the key. No deduction, no bonus, no floor." .
