ex:CR3_ExamV72P a backlog:ChangeRequest ;
    rdfs:label "The exam v7: no deductions, no bonus, five alternatives, short tips, one-page sheet"@en ;
    backlog:requestsChangeTo ex:Scope3 ; backlog:hasChangeDirection backlog:Direction_Grow ; backlog:hasDisposition backlog:Disp_Accepted ; rdfs:seeAlso ex:CR3_MidtermSimplify ;
    backlog:hasChangeRequestRationale "OWNER DECISION (2026-11-02, evening, relayed by the coordinator, answer to the coordinator's one question): 'Accept 7 pages.' The Papers executor of the v7.2 set (session SEN0401-I93-examv72papers, started 2026-11-02T19:19:32Z) STOPPED and delivered nothing: the merged items v1.8.0 need 7.43 columns at the smallest allowed layout setting, paper plus sheet is 7 pages (cover, five question pages, sheet) against the limit of 6, refused even at a 0.5 percent planning margin. The owner's decision: for the set v7_2_0 ONLY the page limit is 7 pages (paper 6 plus sheet 1), nothing is shortened; this is an owner decision against the 6-page rule, recorded, not a waiver for other sets. Everything else of the owner's orders (21:03 the sheet holds the Question 2 answers, 21:06 no code questions, 21:24 plain language with intention and worked solutions in the key) stays. Public commit ec28d45a already holds the new tooling files sen0401_exam_paper_lib_v7_2_0.py, sen0401_exam_papers_build_v7_2_0.py and sen0401_exam_render_v7_2_0.py (no exam text)." .
