ex:Mission7 a backlog:Mission ;
    rdfs:label "Correct the chapter 11 deck and page to the owner's rulings"@en ;
    backlog:missionFor ex:Backlog ;
    backlog:hasMissionStatement "A chapter 11 deck and page that follow the owner's rulings of 2026-11-14 and pass the CME material check, done as an urgent lineage while the sixth lineage is paused." ;
    backlog:hasMissionOrigin "Intent of the seventh lineage, taken from its scope statement ex:Scope7. The seventh lineage is an urgent lineage, not the successor of any lineage, so BRSF's succession rule (one mission continued by predecessor and successor) does not apply to it and it has a mission of its own. Owner direction, 2026-11-26: 'Succession is needed for abnormal closure of the lineages and move some of the scope to a new one. If this is the case you should update the missions to match the BRSF ruling. Yet, each lineage still needs own distinct mission.'" ;
    backlog:hasMissionOutcome backlog:Out_Achieved ;
    backlog:outcomeRationale "An urgent lineage pursues its own closeable intent; sharing the chain's mission would make its closure wait for the chain. Achieved on 2026-11-27: the chapter 11 deck 2.7.0 and page 9.101.0 pass all 9 conditions of the CME material check; the objective's target of 16 counted seven conditions the check does not have and is recorded as missed, not adjusted." ;
    backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner .
ex:Lineage7 rdfs:comment "2026-11-26, on the owner's direction: this lineage is not a succession, so it pursues its own mission ex:Mission7; it pointed to the course mission ex:Mission before."@en .
