    backlog:hasClosureSummary "Closure report of the seventh lineage, 2026-11-27. Achieved: the chapter 11 deck 2.7.0 and page 9.101.0 pass all 9 conditions of the CME material check on a fresh run; titles, visuals, speaker notes, code frames, the replacement story and the analogy removal were corrected and nine independent reviews were answered. Not achieved: the objective target of 16 conditions is not reached, because the check has 9 and seven of the 16 never existed; the objective is recorded as missed at 9 and is not adjusted. Disclosed and carried, not repaired here: chapters 2 and 6 both tell the value overflow story; the no-analogy check does not read the page's concept texts; the review briefs 2 to 9 were fixed by script and not by the freeze command; the box tool does not type the build evidence for an adopting register, so that record was written into the register by hand." ;
    backlog:reportsOnObjective ex:Obj7_Ch11Pass .
